---
---
<div class="wrapper">
  <div class="kanji" aria-hidden="true">日本語</div>
  <div class="hero">
    <div class="hero-text">
      <p class="eyebrow">Curso de japonés · 100% online</p>
      <h1 class="title">
        Aprende japonés de la manera más <em>sencilla</em> y divertida
      </h1>
      <p class="sub">
        Intégrate en la cultura que tanto te apasiona. Con un método probado,
        directo y sin relleno.
      </p>
      <div class="actions">
        <a href="#comprar" class="btn-primary">Quiero aprender japonés</a>
        <span class="btn-ghost">Acceso inmediato</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="video">
      <iframe
        src="https://player.vimeo.com/video/883626042?color&autopause=0&loop=0&muted=0&title=0&portrait=0&byline=0"
        allowfullscreen
        allow="clipboard-write"
        title="Vista previa del curso"
        loading="lazy"
      ></iframe>
      <p class="video-label">Vista previa del curso</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .wrapper {
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .kanji {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 16rem;
    line-height: 1;
    color: #ece9e3;
    position: absolute;
    right: -2rem;
    top: 6rem;
    z-index: 0;
    user-select: none;
    pointer-events: none;
    writing-mode: vertical-rl;
  }

  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh;
    padding: 10rem 2.5rem 6rem;
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
    align-items: center;
    max-width: 1200px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .eyebrow {
    font-size: 0.72rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.18em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-crimson);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease 0.05s both;
  }

  .title {
    font-family: var(--font-serif);
    font-size: 3.2rem;
    line-height: 1.2;
    font-weight: 600;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease 0.1s both;
  }

  .title em {
    color: var(--color-crimson);
    font-style: normal;
  }

  .sub {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    color: #555;
    line-height: 1.7;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
    font-weight: 300;
    max-width: 440px;
    animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease 0.15s both;
  }

  .actions {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 2rem;
    animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease 0.2s both;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--color-crimson);
    color: var(--color-cream);
    padding: 0.9rem 2.2rem;
    font-size: 0.82rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    text-decoration: none;
    font-weight: 500;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    display: inline-block;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    background: var(--color-crimson-dark);
  }

  .btn-ghost {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-edge);
  }

  .video {
    position: relative;
    z-index: 1;
    animation: fadeUp 0.4s ease 0.15s both;
  }

  .video iframe {
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 16 / 9;
    border: none;
    display: block;
  }

  .video-label {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: -1.2rem;
    right: 0;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    letter-spacing: 0.12em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 3rem;
      padding-top: 8rem;
    }

    .title {
      font-size: 2.4rem;
    }

    .kanji {
      font-size: 8rem;
    }
  }
</style>
